msgid "AGuard Safe – Login Security, 2FA, Malware Scan"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: aguard-safe.php
msgid ""
"Watches the site for signs of a break-in and reports them by e-mail: changed"
" core files, new administrators, cloaking, PHP in uploads. Optional e-mail "
"login confirmation, custom login address and file quarantine."
msgstr ""

